 "<div><b>Se estira y cambia de color</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:.78em;opacity:.75\">w, h, fill</div>": "<div><b>Stretches and changes colour</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:.78em;opacity:.75\">w, h, fill</div>",
